msgstr "La chaîne source et la chaîne traduite sont identiques."

msgid ""
"Happens if the source and corresponding translation strings are identical, "
"down to at least one of the plural forms. Some strings commonly found across "
"all languages are ignored, and various markups are stripped. This reduces "
"the number of false positives."
